Cell["\<\
Using \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Operator\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]  keep the Kraus \
index as an extra qudit, so called Stinespring dilation:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996065351045334*^9, 3.996065376595768*^9}, {
  3.9960654184030056`*^9, 
